   "widgets_values": [
    "## regions from cryptomatte\n\n**You need:** a multilayer EXR with a cryptomatte pass (32-bit): Blender View Layer -> Passes -> Cryptomatte ->\nObject (+ Material); Houdini Karma / Mantra, Arnold, Redshift, V-Ray, Octane write it too.\n\n**Do:** paste the file path into node 1, Queue. Every object is a region with its name from the scene; objects named\nalike (`window_left_01`, `_02`) share the group `window_left`; their material is a tag. The plan rules pick them by\n`[group:window*]` or `[tag:glass]`. Connect the plan to the region sampler as in starter 02 (image = the render).\n"
   ],
